          "prompt": "Use this image as reference to create a new variation in the exact same visual style, but replace all text and copy with the following slide content:\n\n=== [REFERENCE STYLE SPECIFICATION] ===\n• Background: Split architectural background: smooth limestone beige on top, warm charcoal on bottom.\n• Top Navigation: High-fashion editorial header with fine hair-line rules and Roman numeral indexing.\n• Typography Hierarchy: High-contrast luxury Didot serif paired with ultra-light geometric sans.\n• Color Highlights: Pastel pink and lime highlighter blocks behind key highlighted words\n• Floating Decals: Minimalist embossed wax seals, clean blind deboss tags, and gold-foil micro accents.\n• Lighting & Finish: Natural architectural window light, gentle highlight roll-off, 50mm optical prime bokeh, medium grain.\n\n=== [SLIDE 1 MISSION: SCROLL-STOPPING VISUAL HERO PIECE] ===\n• Objective: Stop the scroll instantly within 1.5 seconds with a breathtaking, high-aesthetic visual masterpiece.\n• Visual Architecture: Dominant central composition, massive bold stacked typography with vibrant highlighter bars, and playful floating 3D micro-stickers (cherries 🍒, disco ball 🪩, lightning ⚡, cash 💸, pixel mouse cursor 🖱️).\n\n=== [SLIDE 1 VARIATION CONTENT] ===\nSlide Purpose: Slide 1 of 8 (HOOK)\nCard Counter Tag: \"01 // 08\"\nTop Pill Badge: \"SURREAL STREET ART\" with a small pink dot\nMain Headline: \"the jacquemus secret: scale disruption in public streets.\" (Render in massive bold stacked editorial serif with tight leading)\nHighlighter Words: Put a soft pastel pink highlighter bar behind words: \"scale disruption, jacquemus secret\"\nSubtitle / Description: \"How turning giant luxury handbags into public streetcars generated 50M views with zero ad spend.\"\nSpeech Bubble Stickers: \"50M Views\" (green), \"Zero Ad Spend\" (pink)\nBottom Swipe Prompt: \"WHY CLEAN ADS DIE →\"\n\n=== [OUTPUT SPECIFICATIONS] ===\nAspect Ratio: 4:5 vertical portrait (1080x1350) for Instagram Carousel.\nQuality: Ultra-sharp typography, perfect spelling, crisp vector edges, fine paper grain texture, zero AI blur, zero CGI sheen.",
